	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Certo scribitur regem triduo ante acceptam cladem tres crudelissimos <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>carnifices passim per <placeName ref="l832">Galliam</placeName> misisse, qui sine provocatione quidvis <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>in hęreticos statuerent, nimirum ut nemini esset obscurum, quanti faceret <lb xml:id="p1z4"/><placeName ref="l862">Helvetiorum</placeName> et <placeName ref="l822">Germanorum</placeName> preces.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Habet a consiliis unnicum illum cardinalem <lb xml:id="p1z5"/><placeName ref="l691">Lotharingum</placeName>, hominem, ut audio, inexplebilis avaricię et crudelitatis, cuius <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>auspiciis frustra reluctante conestabili superioris etiam anni <placeName ref="l834">Italica</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>expeditio suscepta fuit.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Adducet ille miserum regem in certissimum pręcipitium, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>quod ferendum tamen, nisi etiam ad alios et nos quoque perventurum esset malum.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/>Princeps pacis Iesus Christus nos in suam tutelam susceptos ęternum conservet.!</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="date">[Ohne Datum u. Unterschrift.]</note>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinricho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>suo modis omnibus v<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>enerando charissimoque <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>in Christo fratri.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
